    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nwhichkey, hydra\n\n### Description\n\nMe again ahah\r\n\r\nSince the buffer idea isn't really pertinent, and I want to contribute real bad to this amazing project, is it possible to write the `mini.clue` plugin, which you mention in https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim#planned-modules.\r\n\r\nTotally understand if you were planning to write it yourself though :)",
