            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Just a heads up that the current implementation of `vim.on_key()` is not useable. It's what I initially looked at :)\r\n\r\nInteresting. Thanks for sharing!\r\n\r\nIs it because of \"receive the keys after mappings have been evaluated\"? I didn't do any experiments yet, but at least restricting suggestions only to a subset of mappings (like `<Leader>` in Normal mode) seems doable.",
